|           1 | Ellen      | Abel      |            10 | 50000.00 | IT_PROG |
|           2 | Sundar     | Ande      |            20 | 60000.00 | SA_REP  |
|           3 | David      | Austin    |            10 | 45000.00 | IT_PROG |
